{"about_the_game":"Embrace the spirit of the season with the Halloween Supporter Pack\u2014a chilling collection of exclusive items that will transform your experience into a hauntingly unforgettable adventure. This pack is perfect for those who love to stand out with eerie, eye-catching styles.<br><br>Inside, you\u2019ll find:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Werewolf's Bite \u2013 Unleash your wild side with this fierce archetype appearance.<br></li><li>Death &amp; Decay \u2013 Command the shadows with a look that exudes dark power.<br></li><li>Pitchfork \u2013 A classic Halloween weapon with a sinister twist.<br></li><li>Pine Box \u2013 Add a morbidly stylish edge to your character.<br></li><li>Nevermore \u2013 Channel the ominous elegance of the mysterious raven.<br></li><li>Bat Wing \u2013 Spread your wings and take flight in true Halloween fashion.<br></li><li>Jack-o'-lantern \u2013 Light up the night with this spooktacular head skin.<br></li><li>Grim Reaper \u2013 Step into the role of the ultimate harbinger with this iconic head skin.<br></li><li>Graveyard Fog \u2013 Envelop your character in an eerie, atmospheric material that completes your haunting ensemble.</li></ul><br>Whether you\u2019re battling through the night or just looking to showcase your Halloween spirit, the Halloween Supporter Pack gives you the perfect blend of spooky style and dark sophistication.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100670?t=1762268129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100670?t=1762268129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100670/fce0c8dbb50c5394dfb02e7ecd5cfd172bca2536/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762268129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100670/fce0c8dbb50c5394dfb02e7ecd5cfd172bca2536/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762268129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des